pelican-egg-dune-awakening
==========================

This project ports CubeCoders' AMP module for Dune: Awakening to Pelican / Wings.

The contents of the `scripts/` directory (including `mock-k8s-go`, all
`*.sh` files, and `templates/director.ini`) are copied verbatim from:

  https://github.com/CubeCoders/AMPTemplates

at commit time of the upstream `main` branch when this fork was made. They
are MIT-licensed:

  Copyright (c) 2024 CubeCoders Limited
  See LICENSE for the full grant.

Modifications, additions, and the Pelican egg JSON itself are by
valentin95150@hotmail.fr and contributors, and are also released under MIT.

Funcom owns and distributes the underlying Dune: Awakening dedicated server
binaries. This project does not redistribute Funcom's binaries — they are
fetched on demand from Steam via SteamCMD's anonymous public depot mode at
egg-install time. Operators are responsible for complying with Funcom's
end-user license agreement and self-host server terms.

